### Variables Globales
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8085/api/v1
@token = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### 1. Diagnóstico y Salud
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Login y Autenticación
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 3. Información del Usuario Autenticado
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===========================================================================
### MÓDULO: SEGURIDAD (USUARIOS, SEDES, ROLES)
### ===========================================================================

### Listar usuarios
GET {{baseUrl}}/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar sedes
GET {{baseUrl}}/sedes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar roles
GET {{baseUrl}}/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===========================================================================
### CATÁLOGOS AUXILIARES
### ===========================================================================

### Listar Puertos
GET {{baseUrl}}/catalogos/puertos

### Listar Tipos de Carga
GET {{baseUrl}}/catalogos/tipos-carga

### Listar Mercancías
GET {{baseUrl}}/catalogos/mercancias

### Crear Mercancía
POST {{baseUrl}}/catalogos/mercancias
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "codigo": "MERC-CEL-01",
  "nombre": "Smartphones 5G Gama Alta",
  "categoria": "TECNOLOGIA",
  "requierePermiso": true,
  "entidadReguladora": "MTC",
  "arancelBasePct": 0.00
}

### Borrado Lógico de Mercancía
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/catalogos/mercancias/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reactivar Mercancía
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/catalogos/mercancias/1/reactivar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===========================================================================
### MÓDULO COMERCIAL: CLIENTES
### ===========================================================================

### Listar clientes (solo activos)
GET {{baseUrl}}/clientes?soloActivos=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar prospectos
GET {{baseUrl}}/clientes?prospecto=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear Prospecto / Cliente
POST {{baseUrl}}/clientes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "tipoDocumento": "RUC",
  "numeroDocumento": "20601234567",
  "razonSocial": "IMPORTADORA LOGISTICA DEL SUR S.A.C.",
  "contactoRepresentante": "Carlos Mendoza",
  "direccionFiscal": "Av. Argentina 1840, Lima",
  "correoContacto": "operaciones@logisticadelsur.pe",
  "telefonoContacto": "+51 987 654 321",
  "esProspecto": true
}

### Convertir Prospecto en Cliente Formal
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/clientes/1/convertir-cliente
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===========================================================================
### MÓDULO COMERCIAL: COTIZACIONES
### ===========================================================================

### Listar cotizaciones activas
GET {{baseUrl}}/cotizaciones?soloActivas=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear Cotización Comercial
POST {{baseUrl}}/cotizaciones
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "idCliente": 1,
  "idUsuarioComercial": 1,
  "idMercancia": 1,
  "idTipoCarga": 1,
  "regimenAduanero": "IMPORTACION_DEFINITIVA",
  "idPuertoEnvio": 2,
  "idPuertoDestino": 1,
  "servicioTransporte": true,
  "montoFleteEstimado": 3500.00,
  "montoHonorariosEstimado": 450.00,
  "montoTributosEstimado": 1800.00,
  "totalCotizado": 5750.00,
  "validezDias": 15,
  "observaciones": "Carga prioritaria con contenedor refrigerado"
}

### Revisión Técnica de Cotización por Agente Aduanero (Paso 2)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/cotizaciones/1/revision
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "idAgenteRevisor": 1,
  "estado": "APROBADA",
  "observaciones": "Documentación técnica conforme con partida arancelaria y permiso MTC validado"
}

### ===========================================================================
### MÓDULO OPERACIONES ADUANERAS: EXPEDIENTES
### ===========================================================================

### Listar expedientes activos
GET {{baseUrl}}/expedientes?soloActivos=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Aperturar Expediente desde Cotización Aprobada (Paso 3)
POST {{baseUrl}}/expedientes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "idCotizacion": 1,
  "idAgenteAduanero": 1,
  "contactoExteriorNombre": "Shenzhen Global Electronics Ltd.",
  "contactoExteriorTelefono": "+86 755 12345678",
  "contactoExteriorCorreo": "export@shenzhenglobal.cn",
  "fechaZarpeEtd": "2026-11-01",
  "fechaLlegadaEta": "2026-11-20",
  "numeroContenedor": "MSKU9081234",
  "precintoAduanero": "PE-SUNAT-88771",
  "naveViaje": "CMA CGM TANGER V.102W",
  "observaciones": "Expediente de importación con levante directo programado"
}

### Registrar Canal SUNAT y DAM (Pasos 4, 5 y 6)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/expedientes/1/canal
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "numeroDam": "118-2026-10-123456",
  "canalSunat": "NARANJA",
  "detalleInspeccion": "SUNAT asignó Canal Naranja: revisión documentaria física en depósito temporal"
}

### Autorizar Levante Aduanero
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/expedientes/1/levante
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "detalleInspeccion": "Revisión documentaria conforme por especialista SUNAT. Diligencia aprobada.",
  "observaciones": "Levante concedido. Listo para traslado a depósito y posterior retiro"
}

### ===========================================================================
### MÓDULO ALMACÉN: DEPÓSITOS TEMPORALES Y PESAJE VGM
### ===========================================================================

### Listar registros de almacén
GET {{baseUrl}}/almacen?soloActivos=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Registrar Ingreso a Depósito Temporal (Pasos 5 y 6)
POST {{baseUrl}}/almacen
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "idExpediente": 1,
  "depositoTemporal": "APM Terminals Callao",
  "ubicacionBahia": "Bahía B-14",
  "tipoIngreso": "POST_INSPECCION",
  "finalidadAlmacenaje": "INGRESO_IMPORTACION",
  "diasLibresAlmacen": 15,
  "cantidadBultos": 250,
  "pesoBrutoKg": 14500.50,
  "ticketPesajeVgm": "VGM-2026-99881",
  "precintoConforme": true,
  "observaciones": "Inspección de precinto aduanero conforme"
}

### Autorizar Retiro / Salida de Carga de Almacén
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/almacen/1/autorizar-salida
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "observaciones": "Gastos portuarios cancelados. Salida aprobada con levante concedido"
}

### ===========================================================================
### MÓDULO TRANSPORTE 3NF: CONDUCTORES Y UNIDADES
### ===========================================================================

### Listar Conductores Activos
GET {{baseUrl}}/transporte/conductores?soloActivos=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Registrar Conductor
POST {{baseUrl}}/transporte/conductores
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "nombres": "Marcos",
  "apellidos": "Quispe Huamán",
  "tipoLicencia": "A-IIIc",
  "numeroLicencia": "Q45890123",
  "telefono": "+51 977 112 233"
}

### Listar Unidades Disponibles
GET {{baseUrl}}/transporte/unidades?soloDisponibles=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Registrar Unidad Vehicular (Tracto / Plataforma)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transporte/unidades
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "placaTracto": "V4Z-891",
  "placaCarreta": "TC-332",
  "marcaModelo": "Volvo FH 500",
  "tipoVehiculo": "TRACTO_PLATAFORMA",
  "capacidadCargaKg": 32000.00
}

### ===========================================================================
### MÓDULO TRANSPORTE: DESPACHOS Y TRACKING
### ===========================================================================

### Listar Despachos
GET {{baseUrl}}/transporte/despachos?soloActivos=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Programar Despacho Terrestre (Paso 7)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transporte/despachos
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "idExpediente": 1,
  "tipoTraslado": "ENTREGA_IMPORTACION",
  "direccionPartida": "Av. Manco Cápac 113, Puerto Callao",
  "direccionLlegada": "Av. Los Sauces 450, Almacén Central del Cliente",
  "distritoLlegada": "Ate Vitarte",
  "contactoRecepcion": "Raúl Gómez (Jefe de Almacén)",
  "fechaProgramada": "2026-11-22T08:00:00",
  "observaciones": "Despacho con custodia local obligatoria"
}

### Asignar Chofer y Camión al Despacho (Paso 7)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/transporte/despachos/1/asignar-recursos
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "idConductor": 1,
  "idUnidad": 1,
  "guiaRemisionTransporte": "T001-0004523"
}

### Iniciar Ruta de Transporte
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/transporte/despachos/1/iniciar-ruta
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "observaciones": "Unidad parte de depósito portuario con precinto de seguridad"
}

### Confirmar Entrega en Almacén del Cliente
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/transporte/despachos/1/confirmar-entrega
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "contactoRecepcion": "Raúl Gómez",
  "detalleIncidencia": "Sin incidencias. Carga recibida conforme",
  "observaciones": "Guía de remisión firmada y sellada"
}

### ===========================================================================
### MÓDULO FINANZAS: LIQUIDACIÓN DE COBRANZA
### ===========================================================================

### Listar Liquidaciones
GET {{baseUrl}}/finanzas/liquidaciones
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Emitir Liquidación Financiera Consolidada
POST {{baseUrl}}/finanzas/liquidaciones
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "idExpediente": 1,
  "totalTributosSunat": 6750.00,
  "gastosAlmacenPuerto": 1250.00,
  "fleteTransporteLocal": 1100.00,
  "honorariosAgencia": 850.00,
  "tipoCambio": 3.7500,
  "numeroFactura": "F001-0009841",
  "observaciones": "Cobranza consolidada de derechos arancelarios e impuestos"
}

### Registrar Pago Bancario de la Liquidación
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/finanzas/liquidaciones/1/pago
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "metodoPago": "TRANSFERENCIA_BCP",
  "numeroOperacion": "OP-9988771122",
  "numeroFactura": "F001-0009841",
  "observaciones": "Abono validado en cuenta corriente en soles"
}

### ===========================================================================
### PRUEBAS DE AUTORIZACIÓN POR ROL (8 ROLES DEFINITIVOS)
### ===========================================================================

### 1. Login Administrador TI (ADMINISTRADOR_TI)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 1.1 Administrador TI accede a Logs (200 Permitido)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/logs
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.token}}

### 2. Login Gerente General (GERENTE_GENERAL)
# @name loginGerente
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "gerente",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 2.1 Gerente accede a Usuarios (200 Permitido)
GET {{baseUrl}}/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{loginGerente.response.body.data.token}}

### 2.2 Gerente intenta acceder a Logs TI (403 Prohibido)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/logs
Authorization: Bearer {{loginGerente.response.body.data.token}}

### 3. Login Agente Comercial (AGENTE_COMERCIAL)
# @name loginComercial
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "comercial",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 3.1 Comercial accede a Clientes (200 Permitido)
GET {{baseUrl}}/clientes
Authorization: Bearer {{loginComercial.response.body.data.token}}

### 3.2 Comercial intenta acceder a Usuarios (403 Prohibido)
GET {{baseUrl}}/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{loginComercial.response.body.data.token}}

### 4. Login Supervisor Aduanero (SUPERVISOR_ADUANERO)
# @name loginSupervisor
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "supervisor",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 4.1 Supervisor accede a Expedientes (200 Permitido)
GET {{baseUrl}}/expedientes
Authorization: Bearer {{loginSupervisor.response.body.data.token}}

### 4.2 Supervisor intenta acceder a Usuarios (403 Prohibido)
GET {{baseUrl}}/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{loginSupervisor.response.body.data.token}}

### 5. Login Agente Aduanero (AGENTE_ADUANERO)
# @name loginAgente
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "agente",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 5.1 Agente accede a Expedientes (200 Permitido)
GET {{baseUrl}}/expedientes
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAgente.response.body.data.token}}

### 5.2 Agente intenta acceder a Usuarios (403 Prohibido)
GET {{baseUrl}}/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAgente.response.body.data.token}}

### 6. Login Supervisor de Transporte (SUPERVISOR_TRANSPORTE)
# @name loginTransporte
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "transporte",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 6.1 Supervisor de Transporte accede a Despachos (200 Permitido)
GET {{baseUrl}}/transporte/despachos
Authorization: Bearer {{loginTransporte.response.body.data.token}}

### 6.2 Supervisor de Transporte intenta acceder a Usuarios (403 Prohibido)
GET {{baseUrl}}/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{loginTransporte.response.body.data.token}}

### 7. Login Contador (CONTADOR)
# @name loginContador
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "contador",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 7.1 Contador accede a Liquidaciones Financieras (200 Permitido)
GET {{baseUrl}}/finanzas/liquidaciones
Authorization: Bearer {{loginContador.response.body.data.token}}

### 7.2 Contador intenta acceder a Usuarios (403 Prohibido)
GET {{baseUrl}}/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{loginContador.response.body.data.token}}

### 8. Login Asesor Legal (ASESOR_LEGAL)
# @name loginLegal
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "legal",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 8.1 Asesor Legal accede a Expedientes (200 Permitido)
GET {{baseUrl}}/expedientes
Authorization: Bearer {{loginLegal.response.body.data.token}}

### 8.2 Asesor Legal intenta acceder a Usuarios (403 Prohibido)
GET {{baseUrl}}/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{loginLegal.response.body.data.token}}

